{"root":{"data":{"id":"37593945452e","created":1617784857,"text":"算法Algorithms（via Java）（施工中）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cahcvdrvzkg0","created":1617784862363,"text":"Fundamentals","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cahcziardnk0","created":1617785185668,"text":"Programming Model\n基础编程模型","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cahd148yvfs0","created":1617785311813,"text":"Basic structure of a java program","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cahd75hridc0","created":1617785784707,"text":"primitive data types\n原始数据类型"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cahdc2grx0g0","created":1617786169937,"text":"define integer, number and boolean value"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cahd7che4kg0","created":1617785799922,"text":"statements\n语句"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cahdcnbtnt40","created":1617786215350,"text":"define a computation by creating and assigning values to variables, controlling execution flow, or causing side effects"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cahevvizdig0","created":1617790543227,"text":"6 types"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cahevync15c0","created":1617790550020,"text":"declarations(声明), assignments(赋值), conditionals, loops, calls and returns"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cahev73p4400","created":1617790490060,"text":"Array"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cahewoyz38g0","created":1617790607320,"text":"work with multiple values of the same type"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cahex0bp2jc0","created":1617790632034,"text":"static methods"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cahex3ckvmg0","created":1617790638618,"text":"encapsulate & reuse code to develop programs as a set of indivisual modules"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cahexw5ck200","created":1617790701307,"text":"Strings"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cahexy3qtb40","created":1617790705564,"text":"sequence of characters"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cahey4ehgwg0","created":1617790719275,"text":"Input/Output"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caheydc7gyg0","created":1617790738727,"text":"set up communication between programs and the outside world"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"caheynbb7fk0","created":1617790760441,"text":"Data Abstraction\n数据抽象"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caheyr1hluw0","created":1617790768554,"text":"extends encapsulation and reuse to allow us to define non-primitive data types\nthus supporting object-oriented programming"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cahf5um9m4g0","created":1617791324890,"text":"要执行(invoke)一个Java program，先编译(compile) it via javac command\nthen run it using the java command\n\ni.e. 先输入命令 javac xxxx.java，这样就会自动生成一个 xxxx.class 的字节码文件"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cahf9f0267s0","created":1617791604352,"text":"primitive data types and expressions"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cahfkq5jtg80","created":1617792490635,"text":"data types","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cahfhmyvr680","created":1617792248608,"text":"integers, with arithmetic operations (int)"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cahfi7biwm80","created":1617792292909,"text":"real numbers, with arithmetic operations(double)"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cahfifx02js0","created":1617792311622,"text":"booleans, the set of values(true/false) with logical operations(boolean)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cahfmv7mpfc0","created":1617792658373,"text":"注意Java有 ^ 表示异或\n如果a、b两个值不相同，则异或结果为1。 如果a、b两个值相同，异或结果为0。\ni.e. true ^ true = false"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cahfiy8gudk0","created":1617792351497,"text":"characters, the alphanumeric characters and symbols that you type(char)"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cahfo0se3m00","created":1617792748877,"text":"expressions"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cahfojgjbeg0","created":1617792789518,"text":"arithmetic operator: * 和 /(%) 高于 + 和 -\nlogical operator: ! 优先级最高，其次是 && ，最后是 ||"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cahfpsi9oo00","created":1617792887578,"text":"相同优先级的运算符从左至右，使用括号可以改变这些规则"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cahfq4x7b000","created":1617792914602,"text":"type conversion"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cahfqhpu1680","created":1617792942455,"text":"numbers are automatically promoted to a more inclusive type if no information lost\ne.g. 1 + 2.5 , 1 become 1.0, thus the result is 3.5\n⚠️ 将 double 转为 int 会直接截断(truncation)，而非四舍五入(rounding)"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cahfs60t8g80","created":1617793073726,"text":"comparison"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cahfsfnvum00","created":1617793094712,"text":"mixed-type operators == , !=, >, <  会产生一个bool 的返回"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cahft745hk80","created":1617793154469,"text":"other primitive type","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cahftmebxlk0","created":1617793187736,"text":"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t64-bit integers, with arithmetic operations (long)\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t16-bit integers, with arithmetic operations (short)\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t16-bit characters, with arithmetic operations (char)\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t8-bit integers, with arithmetic operations (byte)\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t32-bit single-precision real numbers, again with arithmetic operations (float) \n\t\t"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cahfuk8jtyo0","created":1617793261397,"text":"statements","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cahzjs2wpi00","created":1617848838662,"text":"declaration"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cai003j5bhc0","created":1617850117416,"text":"create variables of a specified type and name them with identifiers"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cai68ai5pxk0","created":1617867686166,"text":"associate a variable name with a type at compile time\njava 是强类型语言(strongly typed language)， java编译器会检查类型的一致性"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cai00ia4y8o0","created":1617850149522,"text":"assignments"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cai012c2gxc0","created":1617850193175,"text":"associate a data-type value with a variable"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cai01k6l3wg0","created":1617850232025,"text":"java 的声明和赋值是分开的"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cai6jf3gk9k0","created":1617868558167,"text":"an assignment statement associates a data-type value(defined by en expression) with a variable"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cai00u0r0z40","created":1617850175076,"text":"conditionals"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cai01xmc8m00","created":1617850261276,"text":"provide for a simple change in the flow of execution"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cai6j9kbaxs0","created":1617868546125,"text":"if-else"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cai00wmec3c0","created":1617850180739,"text":"loops"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cai025v8dz40","created":1617850279228,"text":"provide for a more profound change in the flow of execution"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cai6kkwoyg00","created":1617868649183,"text":"while"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cai00xwoceo0","created":1617850183537,"text":"calls and returns"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cai02mb66qo0","created":1617850315020,"text":"related to static methods( provide another way to change the flow of execution and to organize code)"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cai6kobbo3s0","created":1617868656598,"text":"break\ncontinue"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cai6lqdhnbs0","created":1617868739446,"text":"shortcut notation"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cai6lzoxdzk0","created":1617868759729,"text":"initializing declaration\n将声明语句和赋值语句结合起来"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cai6m8fkdao0","created":1617868778754,"text":"int i = 1"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cai6mkxbn6g0","created":1617868805949,"text":"implicit assignment\n隐式赋值","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cai6o8videw0","created":1617868936446,"text":"++ i same as i = i + 1\n-- i, i = i - 1\ni /= 2 same as i = i/2\ni += 1 same as i = i + 1"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cai6pi3fd8o0","created":1617869034880,"text":"single-statement blocks\n单语句代码段"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cai6pz0gihs0","created":1617869071706,"text":"if a block of statements in a conditional or a loop has only a single statement, \nthe curly braces may by omitted"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cai6qpppqsg0","created":1617869129830,"text":"for notation\nfor 语句","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cai6qwik97s0","created":1617869144635,"text":"for (<initialize>; <boolean expression>; <increment>)\n{\n\t<block statements>\n}"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cai733yj1io0","created":1617870101207,"text":"Array 数组"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cai73h1i8pk0","created":1617870129686,"text":"An array stores a sequence of values that are all of the same type\n顺序存储相同类型的多个数据"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cai7bk9hau00","created":1617870763611,"text":"","image":"https://kityminder-img.gz.bcebos.com/ae968e14eb84e1ae9e66ef8793507045626819b7","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":200,"height":143}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cai7cfdh4yg0","created":1617870831333,"text":"简化写法，提供的默认初始值都是相同的\n如果想使用不同的初始值，还是需要写循环"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cai7e3shcfk0","created":1617870962848,"text":"数组已经创建，size就是固定的"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cai8cwv1gqg0","created":1617873690512,"text":"static methods 静态方法\ni.e. function"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cai8iym8twg0","created":1617874164517,"text":"arguments are passed by value: function 处理的是参数的值，而非参数本身\nmethod names can be overloaded: e.g. 常见的一种重载是，函数定义两个版本，其中一个需要一个参数，而另一个为该参数提供一个默认值\nA method has a single return value but may have multiple return statements\nA method can have side effects"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"calerev184g0","created":1618196433320,"text":"Recursion"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"calerufbpao0","created":1618196467199,"text":"A method can call itself"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cam90aq998w0","created":1618281762899,"text":"the recursion has a base call\nrecursive calls must address subproblems that are smaller in some sense, so that recursive calls coverage to the base\nrecursive calls should not address subproblems that overlap"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cam92nr2x6g0","created":1618281947975,"text":"basic programming model"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cam92rr68540","created":1618281956688,"text":"a library of static methods is a set of static methods that are defined in a Java class"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cam93jlz0gw0","created":1618282017323,"text":"modular programming","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cam93m6l5so0","created":1618282022923,"text":"libraries of static methods enable modular programming"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cam952h7j7s0","created":1618282136758,"text":"work with modules of reasonable size, even in program involving a large amount of code\nshare and reuse code without reimplement\neasily substitute improved implementations\ndevelop appropriate abstract models for addressing programming problems\nlocalize debugging"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cam9g5zuxq00","created":1618283006422,"text":"unit testing"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cam9gi2kh4w0","created":1618283032707,"text":"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tA best practice in Java programming is to include a main() in every library of static methods that tests the methods in the library \n(some other programming languages disallow multiple main() methods and thus do not support this approach) \n\t\t"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cam9qogupq00","created":1618283830274,"text":"External Libraries/APIs"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cam9rjq18gw0","created":1618283898309,"text":"Strings"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cam9roah36w0","created":1618283908252,"text":"A string is a sequence of characters(char values)\nA literal String is a sequence of characters within double quotes, e.g. \"Hello World\""},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cam9skg56eg0","created":1618283978252,"text":"concatenation"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cam9sqrhlig0","created":1618283991998,"text":"\"AB\" + \"C\" = \"ABC\""},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cam9t6mv3mg0","created":1618284026547,"text":"conversion"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cam9t9ml63k0","created":1618284033061,"text":"str -> int parseInt(String s)"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cam9ttwhg4g0","created":1618284077195,"text":"automatic conversion"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cam9uacf3xk0","created":1618284112987,"text":"\"the square root of 2.0 is \" + Math.sqrt(2.0)\nit would be a String result"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cam9u95v3o00","created":1618284110414,"text":"command-line arguments"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"can5b3amau80","created":1618372884239,"text":"one important use of strings in Java programming is to \nenable a mechanism for passing information from the command line to the program"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"can5dpl6j2g0","created":1618373089495,"text":"input and output"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"can5dsvu0rc0","created":1618373096669,"text":"support a simple model for Java programs to interact with the outside world"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"can7yp054bk0","created":1618380376090,"text":"binary search"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"canzbtyp9r40","created":1618457575588,"text":"data abstraction\nADT(abstract data types)","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"canzf8969tk0","created":1618457841789,"text":"similarity with static methods","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"canzc1xacbk0","created":1618457592917,"text":"both are implemented as a Java class"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"canzc992qy80","created":1618457608867,"text":"instance methods may take zero or more arguments of a specified type, \nseparated by comma and enclosed in parenthese"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"canzd0u15c80","created":1618457668908,"text":"they may provide a return value of a specified type or no return value(signified by void)"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"canzffx8us80","created":1618457858482,"text":"difference "},"children":[{"data":{"id":"canzfsnyi9c0","created":1618457886219,"text":"some entries in the API have the same name as the class and lack a return type\nsuch entries are known as constructors and play a special role"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"canzgi9hg0o0","created":1618457941940,"text":"instance methods lack the static modifier, they are not static methods, \ntheir purpose is to operate on data type values"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"canzhhp4fa00","created":1618458019073,"text":"inherited methods should be shade gray in the API"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cao8bbinwyo0","created":1618482925426,"text":"inherited methods: enable a data type to take advantage of built-in language mechanisms by including specific methods in the API"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caoszz9zq3k0","created":1618541280082,"text":"client code: As with modular programming based on static methods, the API allows us to write client code without knowing details of the implementation"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caot16h51c00","created":1618541374116,"text":"objects","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caot1ey70u00","created":1618541392561,"text":"objects are characterized by 3 essential properties, state, identity and behavior"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caot4r5gnew0","created":1618541654215,"text":"state of an object is a value from its data type\nidentity distinguish one objects from another (the place where the value stored in memory)\nbehavior: the effect of data-type operations"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caou34dnfcg0","created":1618544347390,"text":"creating: every time a client uses new(), the system will\n1.  allocate memory space for the object\n2. invoke the constructor to initialize its value\n3. returns a reference to the object"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"caoubcpmmdc0","created":1618544992441,"text":"using:\ndeclare variables of the type, for use in referring to objects\nuse the keyword new to invoke a constructor that creates objects of the type\nuse the object name to invoke instance methods, either as statements or within expressions"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cap066jvp340","created":1618561513872,"text":"API, clients & implementation"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cap06kf8hmw0","created":1618561544066,"text":"basic components that you need to understand to be able to build and use abstract data types in Java"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"carkfnvu6uo0","created":1618821798989,"text":"Data-type design\n数据类型的设计","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"carkfxj7o480","created":1618821819994,"text":"Encapsulation\n封装"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"carkg0u1i600","created":1618821827179,"text":"OOP(object-oriented programming) enables us to encapsulate data types within their implementations\n简化实现，隔离用例开发"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"carklx4i2f40","created":1618822289289,"text":"Algorithm && abstract data types"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"carklpz71o00","created":1618822273731,"text":"接口继承 && 实现继承\ninterface inheritance && implementation inheritance"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"carko5ni78w0","created":1618822464581,"text":"equality","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"carkp6y242o0","created":1618822545760,"text":"equals must be an equivalence relation\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tReflexive : x.equals(x) is true.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSymmetric : x.equals(y) is true if and only if y.equals(x).\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTransitive : if x.equals(y) and y.equals(z) are true, then so is x.equals(z).\n\n\t   In addition, it must take an Object as argument and satisfy the following properties.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tConsistent : multiple invocations of x.equals(y) consistently return the same value, provided neither object is modified.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNot null : x.equals(null) returns false \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"carkrr6txrs0","created":1618822746554,"text":"memory management"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"carkrvtrykw0","created":1618822756649,"text":"immutability"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"carl5ya4ihs0","created":1618823859089,"text":"该类型的对象中的值在创建之后就无法再被改变"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"carl6gqiawg0","created":1618823899262,"text":"当变量声明为final的时候，就保证了只会对它赋值一次（赋值语句/构造函数）\n视图改变final 变量的值的代码会产生一个编译时错误"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"carl7uy1c480","created":1618824008556,"text":"design by contract"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"carl7y0uifs0","created":1618824015256,"text":"Exception 异常"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"carl8sp01ow0","created":1618824082020,"text":"handle unforeseen errors outside out control"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"carl84akts00","created":1618824028906,"text":"Assertion 断言 "},"children":[{"data":{"id":"carl99p52xc0","created":1618824119034,"text":"verify assumptions that we make within code we develop"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"carlb8kwmc80","created":1618824273330,"text":"summary"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"carlbahnn8g0","created":1618824277487,"text":"java 不允许将函数作为参数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"carlg2i3pag0","created":1618824651920,"text":"原始数据类型更接近计算机硬件支持的数据类型，会比引用类型运行速度更快"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"carlqf9zvo80","created":1618825463370,"text":"Bags, Queues, Stacks"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"carlsrop0yo0","created":1618825647108,"text":" ","image":"https://kityminder-img.gz.bcebos.com/00bf3679ce33260b95255e47cb3472f6a10c49c8","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":195,"height":200}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cas8ahnf45c0","created":1618889100236,"text":"API"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cas6t9v38q80","created":1618884929985,"text":"generics 泛型"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cas6tgq81y00","created":1618884944928,"text":"集合类的抽象数据类型的关键特性就是我们可以用它处理任意类型的数据"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cas8ajy70fk0","created":1618889105241,"text":"Bags"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cas8auosu7c0","created":1618889128618,"text":"A bag is a collection where removing items is not supported"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cas8bg613680","created":1618889175372,"text":"FIFO Queue"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cas8c4jip800","created":1618889228431,"text":"Pushdown stacks"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cas8c89u9r40","created":1618889236553,"text":"LIFO last-in-first-out stack"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cas8n13vby80","created":1618890082960,"text":"Implementing collections"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"casbu34o4y80","created":1618899099241,"text":"fixed-capacity stack，必须指定数据的表示方式，只能有一种类型"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"casbvdlfp0g0","created":1618899200386,"text":"generics 泛型，使用类型参数的占位符，这样元素的类型更加多样"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"casbwu8dwtk0","created":1618899314967,"text":"Array resizing Java 中数组一旦创建，大小无法改变，栈只能使用 maximum space的一部分"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"casbyy8oza80","created":1618899480421,"text":"Loitering 对象游离：Java的垃圾收集策略是回收所有无法呗访问对象的内存，pop()中被弹出元素的引用仍然存在于数组中。\n但这个元素实际上已经是orphan，数组的引用让它无法被回收\n因此，将被弹出的数组元素的值设为null，可以覆盖无用的引用，使系统可以回收这个弹出元素的内存"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"casc21fe0940","created":1618899722449,"text":"Iteration"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"casc2ohx85c0","created":1618899772668,"text":"集合数据类型必须实现一个iterator()方法并返回一个iterator对象"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"casc315hu0o0","created":1618899800215,"text":"iterator 类必须有两个方法，hasNext() 和 next()"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"casc3skiic00","created":1618899859896,"text":"Linked List"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"caseuqr9w880","created":1618907614004,"text":"链表是一种递归的数据结构(recursive data structure)，\neither empty(null) or a reference to a node having a generic item and a reference to a linked list"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"casewcb3o000","created":1618907739279,"text":"node is an abstract entity that may hold any kind of data"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cahcyjuwars0","created":1617785110698,"text":"Sorting"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cahcyokslkw0","created":1617785120971,"text":"Searching"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cahcyqsqww00","created":1617785125806,"text":"Graphs"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cahcytuwjq80","created":1617785132468,"text":"Strings"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cahcyxbt2340","created":1617785140019,"text":"Context"},"children":[]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}